+/** Concurrent C subgroups belong to one bounded AB owner within a warp.
+ * Invalid tails and sparse shells leave inactive slots and still reach the
+ * single warp rendezvous. Heterogeneous views and full-warp subgroups use
+ * the original one-C contraction, including its per-triple gradient scatter.
